      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我能感受到<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳是個\n強大的寶可夢訓練家。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕţ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621180FD611F53D7523000100003110000FF01014F6059B3662F500B000A5F37592776845BF653EF59228A137DF45BB6300200100002011401630000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "想要戰勝這樣的<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳，\n唯有單點突破！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n用我深愛不已的屬性……\n蟲屬性的寶可夢們進行攻擊！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕţ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "60F38981623052DD90196A23768400100003110000FF01014F6059B3FF0C000A552F670955AE9EDE7A817834FF0100100001BE01000A752862116DF1611B4E0D5DF276845C6C602720262026000A87F25C6C602776845BF653EF592250119032884C653B64CAFF0100100002011401630000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "智謀由愛而生，\n並且能孕育出強大的實力！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n來！與我一決勝負吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕţ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "667A8B007531611B800C751FFF0C000A4E264E1480FD5B5580B251FA5F37592776845BE6529BFF0100100001BE00000A4F86FF01820762114E006C7A52DD8CA05427FF0100100002011401630000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳願意與我一決勝負的話，\n請帶著覺悟來告訴我！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕţ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B39858610F820762114E006C7A52DD8CA076848A71FF0C000A8ACB5E36845789BA609F4F86544A8A346211FF0100100002011401630000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "來！與我的蟲屬性寶可夢們\n一決勝負吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕţ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F86FF0182076211768487F25C6C60275BF653EF59225011000A4E006C7A52DD8CA05427300200100002011401630000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "對戰吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C0D62305427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不要",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D89810000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "唉呀？火、岩石、飛行屬性\n可都是蟲屬性的弱點呢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕţ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55095440FF1F706B30015CA977F3300198DB884C5C6C6027000A53EF90FD662F87F25C6C602776845F319EDE5462300200100002011401630000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "為了激發出我深愛的\n蟲寶可夢的潛力，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n我會使用超級進化的！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕţ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "70BA4E866FC0767C51FA62116DF1611B7684000A87F25BF653EF592276846F5B529BFF0C00100001BE00000A621167034F7F75288D857D1A903253167684FF0100100002011401630000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "超級進化的凱羅斯，\n還有其他的大家，辛苦你們了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕţ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8D857D1A90325316768451F17F8565AFFF0C000A9084670951764ED6768459275BB6FF0C8F9B82E64F6050114E86300200100002011401630000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "話說回來，\n使用超級進化的訓練家變多了呢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕţ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8A718AAA56DE4F86FF0C000A4F7F75288D857D1A9032531676848A137DF45BB68B8A591A4E865462300200100002011401630000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "雖然這只是個傳聞，\n但闊星公司之所以能開發超級環，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n據說是因為背後有個叫AZ的人物。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕţ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96D67136901953EA662F500B50B3805EFF0C000A4F4695CA661F516C53F84E4B62404EE580FD958B767C8D857D1A74B0FF0C00100001BE00000A64DA8AAA662F56E070BA80CC5F8C6709500B53EB0041005A76844EBA7269300200100002011401630000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "原來如此！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "539F4F8659826B64FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "真是厲害",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "771F662F53B25BB30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這個叫AZ的人似乎\n曾在叫做豐緣的遙遠地方<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n得知了可說是超級進化起源的現象，<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n然後獨自進行了調查。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕţ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9019500B53EB0041005A76844EBA4F3C4E4E000A66FE572853EB505A8C507DE3768490599060573065B900100001BE00000A5F9777E54E8653EF8AAA662F8D857D1A903253168D776E90768473FE8C61FF0C00100001BE01000A71365F8C736881EA9032884C4E868ABF67E5300200100002011401630000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "據說他把當時的調查結果\n分享給了闊星公司。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n不知道他是有什麼打算呢？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕţ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "64DA8AAA4ED6628A7576664276848ABF67E57D50679C000A52064EAB7D664E8695CA661F516C53F8300200100001BE00000A4E0D77E590534ED6662F67094EC09EBC62537B975462FF1F00100002011401630000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "反正對我而言，\n只要能讓心愛的寶可夢超級進化，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n我就非常非常非常滿足了！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n讓我們好好珍惜超級進化吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕţ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53CD6B635C0D6211800C8A00FF0C000A53EA898180FD8B935FC3611B76845BF653EF59228D857D1A90325316FF0C00100001BE00000A62115C31975E5E38975E5E38975E5E386EFF8DB34E86FF0100100001BE01000A8B9362115011597D597D73CD60DC8D857D1A903253165427300200100002011401630000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
